        "description": {
          "text": "Manufacturing/labeling change: removed the 50 mg capsule dosage form and updated dose reduction tables for coadministration with strong or moderate CYP3A4 inhibitors; no change to indication",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental new drug application provides for modifications to Table 1 entitled Recommended Dose Reductions with BRAFTOVI in the DOSAGE AND ADMINISTRATION, Dose Modifications for Adverse Reactions (2.3) subsection and to the Dose Modifications for Coadministration with Strong or Moderate CYP3A4 Inhibitors (2.4) subsection, to include the addition of a new Table 3 entitled \"Recommended Dose Reductions for BRAFTOVI for coadministration with Strong or Moderate CYP3A4 Inhibitors\" to reflect the removal of the 50 mg capsule dosage form from DOSAGE FORM AND STRENGTHS (3) for encorafenib in combination with binimetinib for the treatment of patients with unresectable or metastatic melanoma with BRAF V600E or V600K mutation, as detected by an FDA-approved test.",
